X:1
T:Wake, Awake, for Night Is Flying
T:WACHET AUF
C:Music: Phillip Nicolai, 1599 · Words: Phillipp Nicolai, 1599. Translated by Catherine Winkworth, 1858
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: 'Common Service Book with Hymnal', ULCA, 1917 Hymn 5.. The hymnary.org score found for comparison (hymnary.org/tune/wachet_auf_nicolai) is a different tune or version, so the melody follows the Open Hymnal's source.
M:none
L:1/4
Q:1/4=150
